# Tool versions this repo's config was last checked against.
#
#   ./dotctl versions                  drift report (tested vs installed)
#   ./dotctl versions accept <tool>    after reviewing the changes: record the
#                                      installed version and sync in-file copies
#                                      (.tmux.conf @target_version, nvim init.lua)
#
# Columns (whitespace-separated; probe is the rest of the line):
#   tool     brew formula name when pin is set
#   tested   version the config was checked against
#   checked  date of that check
#   pin      -      not brew-pinned, upgrades whenever brew/the app does
#            exact  brew-pinned, only `dotctl versions upgrade` moves it
#            patch  brew-pinned, the homebrew-update cron may apply patch upgrades
#            minor  brew-pinned, the cron may apply minor and patch upgrades
#   changes  where to read what changed: file path, URL, nvim:help-news, or
#            git-log (git log <tested>..HEAD in the checkout the probe names)
#   probe    command printing the installed version; the first X.Y[.Z] token
#            (or the first word, cut to 7 chars for a git SHA) is compared
#
# tool                    tested    checked     pin    changes                                         probe
tmux                      3.8       2026-10-20  patch  /opt/homebrew/opt/tmux/CHANGES                  tmux -V
neovim                    0.12.6    2026-10-20  patch  nvim:help-news                                  nvim --version
fzf                       0.74.5    2026-10-20  patch  https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/releases        fzf --version
ghostty                   1.3.1     2026-10-20  -      https://ghostty.org/docs/install/release-notes  /Applications/Ghostty.app/Contents/MacOS/ghostty --version
claude-code               2.1.304   2026-10-20  -      https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog       claude --version
macos                     27.2      2026-10-20  -      -                                               sw_vers -productVersion
oh-my-zsh                 d57775d   2026-10-20  -      git-log                                         git -C ~/.oh-my-zsh rev-parse HEAD
powerlevel10k             36f3045   2026-10-20  -      git-log                                         git -C ~/.oh-my-zsh/custom/themes/powerlevel10k rev-parse HEAD
zsh-vi-mode               4cbbd1b   2026-10-20  -      git-log                                         git -C ~/.oh-my-zsh/custom/plugins/zsh-vi-mode rev-parse HEAD
fast-syntax-highlighting  3d574cc   2026-10-20  -      git-log                                         git -C ~/.oh-my-zsh/custom/plugins/fast-syntax-highlighting rev-parse HEAD
tmux-resurrect            cfd2386   2026-10-20  -      git-log                                         git -C ~/.tmux/plugins/tmux-resurrect rev-parse HEAD
